<title>USA: Applied Imaging names Goldstein as CEO.</title>
<headline>Applied Imaging names Goldstein as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Imaging Corp said Thursday it named Jack Goldstein as chief executive officer, president and director.</p>
<p>Most recently, Goldstein was executive vice president of professional diagnostics for Johnson &amp; Johnson.</p>
<p>Abe Coriat, the founder and chairman of Applied Imaging, was previously the CEO. He will continue as chairman, while Goldstein will be responsible for day-to-day operations, the company said.</p>
